    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Welcome to the Big City</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You\u2019ve just arrived in the bustling metropolis, ready to carve out your own path.\u00a0 You'll need to manage your finances, energy, and time if you wish to stay!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031440/extras/64668aabbdf8d992ae534aac31ac0693.avif?t=1731973761\" width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hop on public transit and discover the city\u2019s diverse neighborhoods and iconic landmarks. Visit churches, gyms, libraries, and parks as you uncover hidden spots and local favorites.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031440/extras/51a3f3ac585acbd642c88f2bda2d6824.avif?t=1731973761\" width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Work</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn a living within Retroronto by engaging in minigames representing urban professions. Deposit your hard-earned cash at the city\u2019s banks to stay on top of your rent and expenses.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031440/extras/2a725b5dd202b7fea2dd18b5f6c90196.avif?t=1731973761\" width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Connect</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with a range of characters as they go about their daily lives. Building relationships with the locals can open doors to new places, jobs, and unexpected opportunities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031440/extras/52ce93b9764ab0709d5535d4de61f59d.avif?t=1731973761\" width=800 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come join Retroronto on it's development journey and help us build a community by giving us your feedback in our Discord channel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Features:</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-world:</strong>\u00a0Experience a vibrant, pixel-art rendition of Toronto, filled with diverse neighborhoods, iconic landmarks, and hidden gems to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization:\u00a0</strong>Character Customization: Personalize your character\u2019s appearance with a variety of options to suit your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel-art Graphics:\u00a0</strong>Enjoy a charming visual aesthetic that pays homage to classic games while bringing Toronto to life through detailed pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chiptune/Indie Soundtrack</strong>: Immerse yourself in an engaging soundtrack crafted from chiptune and indie influences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack</strong>: An expanding list of chiptune and indie-genre music reflecting the city's own music scene and the game's retro aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031440/extras/79121d5f9dfb9c6e9caa15cdbaf884f5.avif?t=1731973761\" width=256 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope we can count on your support, the best and easiest way is to wishlist our game!</p>",
